logs/security/

# Design docs (internal planning)
docs/superpowers/

# Local dump of reference addons (ElvinCDs, Forte, ClassTimer, etc.)
# used for curation lookups. Never ship; never commit.
3.3.5.a/

# Local reference copies of third-party addons (each separately licensed
# under its own terms). Never ship; never commit. Matched by pattern rather
# than named one at a time: every one seen so far is a GitHub codeload-style
# checkout folder ending in "-main" of a "<AddonName>-Grimfall" repo (e.g.
# Xperl-Grimfall-main/, DragonUI-Grimfall-main/), and the owner keeps adding
# these for curation lookups, so a class-covering pattern catches the next
# one on arrival instead of needing a .gitignore edit every time.
*-Grimfall-main/
